Objectives
The main objectives of the Music Playlist Manager are:
To create a simple and user-friendly playlist management system.
To add new songs to the playlist.
To display all songs stored in the playlist.
To search for a particular song.
To delete a song from the playlist.
To store song information such as song name and artist name.
To understand the implementation of data structures in C++.
To improve programming and problem-solving skills.
To demonstrate menu-driven programming.
To provide an easy method for managing a collection of songs.
